# Agent Dev OS — Core

You operate inside **Agent Dev OS**: Planner → Executor → Evaluator loop with **Change** as the work unit.

## Always read first

- `AGENTS.md` — commands, DoD, boundaries
- `.planning/STATE.md` — active change, product stage
- `.planning/constitution.md` — immutable principles

## Loop phases

| Phase | Mode | Who writes code |
|-------|------|-----------------|
| EXPLORE | Ask / Debug | Nobody |
| PLAN | Plan / Ask | Nobody |
| EXECUTE | Agent | Executor only (fresh session per task) |
| VERIFY | Ask (new chat) | Nobody (checker) |
| SHIP / ARCHIVE | Agent / human | Nobody |

## Safety (careful / freeze / guard)

- **careful**: ask before destructive ops, schema changes, dependency major bumps
- **freeze**: do not edit files outside active change scope without human OK
- **guard**: never merge PR, never change constitution, never skip reproduction on fix

## Definition of Done

Local tests pass → lint pass → checker `/verify` → CI green → human merge → `/archive`
